  "Subdivision geometry unavailable: {error}": "一级行政区边界不可用：{error}",
  "Loading this region boundary; its bounding rectangle is available now.": "正在加载此行政区边界；目前可先使用其外接矩形。",
  "This region extends beyond local UTM clipping coverage. Its bounding rectangle remains available for catalogue search.": "该行政区超出本地 UTM 裁剪支持的纬度；仍可用外接矩形搜索目录。",
